  'Oito2Theme': ApiEntry(kind: 'abstract class', package: 'oito2_ui', doc: 'Builds the oito2 Material 3 [ThemeData].\n\nThe platform drives density, control sizes, tap targets, splash effects\nand page transitions. [light], [dark] and [fromColors] take it as an\noptional [Oito2Platform] that defaults to [Oito2Platform.current];\n[fromSystem] takes it from the settings.', signature: '', constructors: [ApiConstructor(name: 'Oito2Theme', doc: '', isConst: false, isFactory: false, parameters: [])], properties: [], methods: [ApiMember(name: 'light', signature: 'static light(Color? accent, bool highContrast, Oito2Platform? platform) → ThemeData', doc: 'The light oito2 base theme with [accent] as the primary hue.'), ApiMember(name: 'dark', signature: 'static dark(Color? accent, bool highContrast, Oito2Platform? platform) → ThemeData', doc: 'The dark oito2 base theme with [accent] as the primary hue.'), ApiMember(name: 'fromSystem', signature: 'static fromSystem(Oito2SystemSettings settings, Brightness brightness, Color? accent) → ThemeData', doc: 'The theme that follows the system [settings] for [brightness].\n\nBuilds the base theme with [accent], falling back to the system\naccent color, and the system high-contrast preference. The platform\ncomes from [settings].'), ApiMember(name: 'fromColors', signature: 'static fromColors(Oito2ColorTheme colors, Oito2Platform? platform) → ThemeData', doc: 'The theme for already resolved [colors].\n\n[colors] provides the `ColorScheme`, the scaffold background and the\ncolor [ThemeExtension]s ([Oito2ColorTheme.semantic],\n[Oito2ColorTheme.chrome] and [Oito2ColorTheme.syntax] wrapped in\n[Oito2SyntaxTheme]); the theme also carries the navigation, progress\nand title bar extensions derived from them.\n\nCalls with an equal [colors] and platform return the same\n[ThemeData] instance while it stays among the 16 most recently used.')], values: []),
